  "notes": "Bootstrap-flavoured Electron-style Instagram DM client. Top bar and pane backgrounds use very subtle white→light-grey vertical gradients. Received bubbles are near-white rectangles with a tiny 10px sender name above the text and a right-aligned 10px 'HH:MM - Mon DD' stamp; sent bubbles are saturated blue gradient with white text and rounded corners. Group chats show 3–5 overlapping cartoon avatars in a row. Unread rows get blue bold snippet text plus a blue dot that overlaps the relative time. Selected row is grey (#dfdfdf). Composer is a plain borderless textarea with outline paperclip and smiley icons."
